  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-Women&apos;s World Banking</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender-Women&apos;s World Banking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WWB is a global network of microfinance providers &amp; banks bringing financial services &amp; info to low-income entrepreneurs, serving 25M clients. Five objectives: Be the pre-eminent voice for women in microfinance, Expand outreach of the network to low-income women, Deepen the impact of network members on low-income women, Foster learning and collaboration across the network, High org. performance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WWB &#xe4;r en global netv&#xe4;rk av mikrofinans institutioner &amp; banker som bringar finansiell service &amp; info till entrepren&#xf6;rer med l&#xe5;ga inkomster, med 25m kunder. Fem m&#xe5;l: Att vara en framst&#xe5;ende r&#xf6;st f&#xf6;r kvinnor inom mikrofinans, Ut&#xf6;ka n&#xe4;tverkets genomslag bland kvinnor med l&#xe5;g inkomst, F&#xf6;rdjupa medlemmarnas genomslag hos dessa kvinnor, Bygg upp l&#xe4;rande &amp; samarbete inom n&#xe4;tverket, H&#xf6;g org. prestation.</narrative>
  </description>
